30904      title 'Spatial Correlation Analysis with PROC VARIOGRAM';
30905      ods graphics on;
30906      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick plots=pairs(thr=30);
30907      compute novariogram nhc=20;
30908      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30909      var Thick;
30910      run;

NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed page 1933.

30911      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv;
30912      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 cl robust;
30913      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30914      var Thick;
30915      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
NOTE: The data set WORK.OUTV has 12 observations and 9 variables.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE VARIOGRAM printed pages 1934-1935.

30916      proc variogram data=sashelp.thick outv=outv plots(only)=moran;
30917      compute lagd=7 maxlag=10 autocorr(assum=random);
30918      coordinates xc=East yc=North;
30919      var Thick;
30920      run;

NOTE: No DIRECTIONS statement and no NDIRECTIONS=, or NDIRECTIONS=0 specified: Computing omnidirectional semivariogram.
